   "RoleTowerStarDesc_1_1": "Xiangli Yao deals more total DMG.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Intro Skill</color> fully restores <color=Highlight>Capacity</color>.\n<color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Decipher</color> deals more total DMG. After casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill-  Decipher</color>, cast <color=Highlight>Mid-air Attack - Revamp</color> to immediately enter <color=Highlight>Intuition</color>.\n<size=10></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Intuition</color>, <color=Highlight>hold Normal Attack</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack: Charged Shot</color>.",
