+  "RoleTowerStarDesc_2_1": "Jinhsi deals more total DMG.\n<color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Illuminous Epiphany</color> deals more total DMG.\nWhen a Resonator in the team defeats a target, Jinhsi gains <color=Highlight>Evanescence</color>, stacking up to <SapTag=0>{0}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=time P=times SapTag=0}.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Crescent Divinity</color> removes all stacks of <color=Highlight>Evanescence</color> to increase the total DMG of this <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Crescent Divinity</color> and restore <color=Highlight>Incandescence</color>.\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Incarnation</color>, <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack</color> is replaced with <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Soaring Loong</color> and <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Diving Loong</color>. <color=Highlight>Hold Normal Attack</color> to consume <color=Highlight>Incandescence</color> and generate <color=Highlight>Lightning Smite</color> and <color=Highlight>Thunder Shock</color>, dealing <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color>.\n<color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Crescent Divinity</color> has increased travel distance.",
   "RoleTowerStarDesc_2_2": "When a Resonator in the team deals Coordinated Attack DMG, Jinhsi restores additional <color=Highlight>Incandescence</color>.\nJinhsi's <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation</color> deals more total DMG.",
   "RoleTowerStarDesc_2_3": "Casting <color=Highlight>Intro Skill</color> fully restores <color=Highlight>Incandescence</color>.\n<color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Soaring Loong</color>, <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Diving Loong</color>, <color=Highlight>Lightning Smite</color>, <color=Highlight>Thunder Shock</color>, and <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Illuminous Epiphany</color> deal more total DMG.",
   "RoleTowerStarDesc_3_1": "Changli deals more total DMG.\nWhen <color=Highlight>True Sight: Conquest</color> or <color=Highlight>True Sight: Charge</color> hits a target, Changli gains extra <color=Highlight>Enflamement</color>.\nExcess <color=Highlight>Enflamement</color> can be converted to <color=Highlight>Flaming Feather</color>. After casting <color=Highlight>Enhanced Heavy Attack</color>, <color=Highlight>Flaming Feather</color> can be converted to <color=Highlight>Enflamement</color>.\nAfter casting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Flaming Sacrifice</color>, Changli enters True Sight.\nAfter casting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Flaming Sacrifice</color> 3 times, <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation - Heavenfire Dominion</color> becomes available.",
   "RoleTowerStarDesc_3_2": "Defeating enemy targets grants extra <color=Highlight>Enflamement</color>.\n<color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation</color> deals more total DMG.",
   "RoleTowerStarDesc_3_3": "<color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Flaming Sacrifice</color> deals more total DMG.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation - Heavenfire Dominion</color> grants <color=Highlight>Lone Feather</color>. If Changli is hit or launched while holding <color=Highlight>Lone Feather</color>, she immediately and automatically recovers from the attack. <color=Highlight>Lone Feather</color> is removed after this effect is triggered.",
   "RoleTowerStarDesc_4_1": "Camellya deals more total DMG.\n<size=10></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Blossom Mode</color>, Camellya gains the following effects:\n- Remaining time counts down faster.\n- <color=Highlight>Basic Attack</color> deals more total DMG.\n<size=10></size>\nOutside <color=Highlight>Blossom</color> Mode, Camellya gains the following effects:\n- Dealing DMG stacks <color=Highlight>Creeping Vines</color>.\n- <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill: Cluster Blossoms</color> becomes available once <color=Highlight>Creeping Vines</color> reaches a certain number of stacks.",
-  "RoleTowerStarDesc_4_2": "While in <color=Highlight>Blossom Mode</color>, <color=Highlight>Forte Circuit - Ephemeral</color> deals DMG multiple times and adds extra DMG to subsequent attacks.\nOutside <color=Highlight>Blossom Mode</color>, <color=Highlight>Forte Circuit - Ephemeral</color> deals more total DMG.",
+  "RoleTowerStarDesc_4_2": "While in <color=Highlight>Blossom Mode</color>, <color=Highlight>Forte Circuit - Ephemeral</color> and <color=Highlight>Forte Circuit - Perennial</color> deal DMG multiple times and add extra DMG to subsequent attacks.\nOutside <color=Highlight>Blossom Mode</color>, <<color=Highlight>Forte Circuit - Ephemeral</color> and <color=Highlight>Forte Circuit - Perennial</color> deal more total DMG.",
   "RoleTowerStarDesc_4_3": "While in <color=Highlight>Blossom Mode</color>, <color=Highlight>Basic Attack</color> deals more total DMG.\nOutside <color=Highlight>Blossom Mode</color>, <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Cluster Blossoms</color> deals more total DMG.",
   "RoleTowerStarDesc_5_1": "Carlotta deals more total DMG.\nOutside the <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation</color> enhanced state, casting <color=Highlight>Intro Skill</color> fully restores Carlotta's <color=Highlight>Substance</color>.\nWhile in the <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation</color> enhanced state, Carlotta gains the following effects:\n- <color=Highlight>Death Knell</color> deals additional DMG and reduces more Vibration Strength. It also increases the total DMG of <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation - Fatal Finale</color>, with a greater increase against immobilized targets.\n- Casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill</color> resets the charges of <color=Highlight>Death Knell</color>.\n- When <color=Highlight>Forte Gauge</color> is full, reset the Cooldown of <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill</color>.",
   "RoleTowerStarDesc_5_2": "Casting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Imminent Oblivion</color> or <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Containment Tactics</color> grants Carlotta <color=Highlight>Iridescent Prism</color>, which increases her total DMG.",
