   "RoleTowerStarDetailDesc_5_1": "Carlotta deals {0} more total DMG.\n<size=10></size>\nOutside <color=Highlight>Twilight Tango</color>, casting <color=Highlight>Intro Skill</color> restores <SapTag=1>{1}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=point P=points SapTag=1} of <color=Highlight>Substance</color>.\n<size=10></size>\nWhile Carlotta is in <color=Highlight>Twilight Tango</color>, she gains the following effects:\n- Casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Art of Violence</color> or <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Chromatic Splendor</color> removes all <color=Highlight>Meta Vector</color>, grants <color=Highlight>Final Bow</color>, and refreshes the duration of <color=Highlight>Twilight Tango</color>.\n- When <color=Highlight>Meta Vector</color> reaches {2} points, the Cooldowns of <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Art of Violence</color> and <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Chromatic Splendor</color> are reset.\n- <color=Highlight>Death Knell</color> is cast faster. Casting <color=Highlight>Death Knell</color> generates <color=Highlight>Glimmer Shards</color> around Carlotta, in total dealing <color=Ice>Glacio DMG</color> to enemies with a DMG Multiplier equal to {3} of <color=Highlight>Death Knell</color>'s, considered <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill</color> DMG. <color=Highlight>Glimmer Shards</color> also reduce more of enemies' Vibration Strength.\n- Casting <color=Highlight>Mid-air Attack</color> shortly after <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Chromatic Splendor</color> generates <color=Highlight>Glimmer Shards</color>, restores {4} points of Concerto Energy, and grants <SapTag=5>{5}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=point P=points SapTag=5} of <color=Highlight>Meta Vector</color>, in total dealing <color=Ice>Glacio DMG</color> with a DMG Multiplier equal to {6} of <color=Highlight>Death Knell</color>'s, considered <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill</color> DMG.\n- Shortly after a successful Dodge or <color=Highlight>Mid-air Attack</color>, <color=Highlight>{Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} Normal Attack</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Death Knell</color>.\n- Casting <color=Highlight>Death Knell</color> grants <SapTag=7>{7}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=7} of <color=Highlight>Glorious Finale</color>. Each stack of <color=Highlight>Glorious Finale</color> increases the total DMG of <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation - Fatal Finale</color> by {8}, up to {9}. Against immobilized targets, the increase becomes {10} per stack, up to {11}. Casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation - Fatal Finale</color> removes <color=Highlight>Glorious Finale</color>.",
   "RoleTowerStarDetailDesc_5_2": "Casting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Imminent Oblivion</color> or <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Containment Tactics</color> grants Carlotta <SapTag=0>{0}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=0} of <color=Highlight>Iridescent Prism</color>.\nEach stack of <color=Highlight>Iridescent Prism</color> increases Carlotta's total DMG by {1}, up to {2}.",
