-  "Skill_1006302_SkillDescribe": "<size=40><color=Title>Resonance Skill - Nightmare Blend</color></size>\nLily starts with <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color> by default. When <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color> is active, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} Resonance Skill to switch to <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color>, dealing <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color> to nearby targets.\nThis skill shares a Cooldown with <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Reverie Blend</color>.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Resonance Skill - Reverie Blend</color></size>\nWhen <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color> is active, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} Resonance Skill to switch to <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color>, dealing <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color> to nearby targets.\nThis skill shares a Cooldown with <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Nightmare Blend</color>.",
+  "Skill_1006302_SkillDescribe": "<size=40><color=Title>Resonance Skill - Nightmare Blend</color></size>\nLily starts with <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color> by default. When <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color> is active, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} Resonance Skill to deal <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color> to nearby targets, then switch to <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color>.\nThis skill shares a Cooldown with <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Reverie Blend</color>.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Resonance Skill - Reverie Blend</color></size>\nWhen <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color> is active, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} Resonance Skill to deal <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color> to nearby targets, then switch to <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color>.\nThis skill shares a Cooldown with <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Nightmare Blend</color>.",
   "Skill_1006302_SkillName": "Dream Blend",
   "Skill_1006302_SkillResume": "<size=40><color=Title>Nightmare Blend</color></size>\nWhen <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color> is active, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} Resonance Skill to switch to <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color>, dealing <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color>.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Reverie Blend</color></size>\nWhen <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color> is active, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} Resonance Skill to switch to <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color>, dealing <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color>.",
-  "Skill_1006303_SkillDescribe": "Casting this skill sends Lily into <color=Highlight>Slumberland</color> and grants <color=Highlight><te href=151203>Cradle Lullaby</te></color> to Resonators in the team.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Slumber</color></size>\nLasts for 50s. When Lily is in <color=Highlight>Slumberland</color>, she heals the nearby active Resonator every 3s. During <color=Highlight>Slumberland</color>, use directional input to command <color=Highlight>Dreambind</color> to deal <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color> to nearby targets. <color=Highlight>Dreambind</color> pulls in targets within a certain range every 5s, and stops attacking 10s after movement stops. {Cus:Ipt,Touch=Tap PC=Press Gamepad=Press} Resonance Liberation again during <color=Highlight>Slumberland</color> to end it early.\nWhen Lily is in <color=Highlight>Slumberland</color>, when a Resonator in the team casts <color=Highlight>Intro Skill</color>, targets within a certain range are pulled in.\nSwitching to another Resonator during <color=Highlight>Slumberland</color> keeps Lily on the field, and she takes no DMG while in <color=Highlight>Slumberland</color>. Lily leaves the field when <color=Highlight>Slumberland</color> ends, or earlier if she gets too far from the active Resonator.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Cradle Lullaby</color></size>\nLasts for 25s. While this effect is active, each <color=Highlight>Intro Skill</color> cast by a Resonator in the team grants 1 stack of <color=Highlight><te href=151204>Dream Aroma</te></color>. This effect is removed when Lily is the incoming Resonator.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Dream Aroma</color></size>\nEach stack increases the ATK of all Resonators in the team by 7%, stacking up to 4 times. This effect is removed when Lily is the incoming Resonator or when <color=Highlight>Cradle Lullaby</color> ends.",
+  "Skill_1006303_SkillDescribe": "Casting this skill sends Lily into <color=Highlight>Slumberland</color> and grants <color=Highlight><te href=151203>Cradle Lullaby</te></color> to Resonators in the team.\nCasting this skill also grants Lily a Shield equal to 100% of her Max HP for 4s. This Shield does not carry over to the incoming Resonator.\nCan be cast in mid-air close to the ground.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Slumber</color></size>\nLasts for 50s. When Lily is in <color=Highlight>Slumberland</color>, she heals the nearby active Resonator every 3s. During <color=Highlight>Slumberland</color>, use directional input to command <color=Highlight>Dreambind</color> to deal <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color> to nearby targets. <color=Highlight>Dreambind</color> pulls in targets within a certain range every 5s, and stops attacking 10s after movement stops. {Cus:Ipt,Touch=Tap PC=Press Gamepad=Press} Resonance Liberation again during <color=Highlight>Slumberland</color> to end it early.\nWhen Lily is in <color=Highlight>Slumberland</color>, when a Resonator in the team casts <color=Highlight>Intro Skill</color>, targets within a certain range are pulled in, triggered once every 10s. Lily is immune to interruption during <color=Highlight>Slumberland</color> and takes 50% less DMG.\nSwitching to another Resonator during <color=Highlight>Slumberland</color> keeps Lily on the field. Lily leaves the field when <color=Highlight>Slumberland</color> ends, or earlier if she gets too far from the active Resonator.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Cradle Lullaby</color></size>\nLasts for 25s. While this effect is active, each <color=Highlight>Intro Skill</color> cast by a Resonator in the team grants 1 stack of <color=Highlight><te href=151204>Dream Aroma</te></color>. This effect is removed when Lily is the incoming Resonator.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Dream Aroma</color></size>\nStacks up to 4 times. Each stack increases the ATK of all Resonators on the team by 0.1% for every 1% of Lily's Energy Regen above 190%, up to 7%. This effect is removed when Lily is the incoming Resonator or when <color=Highlight>Cradle Lullaby</color> ends.",
   "Skill_1006303_SkillName": "Into the Dream Cradle",
-  "Skill_1006303_SkillResume": "Casting this skill sends Lily into <color=Highlight>Slumberland</color> and grants <color=Highlight>Cradle Lullaby</color> to all Resonators in the team.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Slumberland</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Slumberland</color>, Lily continuously heals the active Resonator.\nDuring <color=Highlight>Slumberland</color>, when a Resonator in the team casts <color=Highlight>Intro Skill</color>, targets within a certain range are pulled in.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Cradle Lullaby</color></size>\nWhile this effect is active, when the active Resonator casts <color=Highlight>Intro Skill</color>, the ATK of all Resonators in the team is increased. This effect is removed when Lily is the incoming Resonator.",
