-  "Skill_1006305_SkillDescribe": "While the active Resonator has 50% or more HP, Lily grants them 10% DMG Reduction.\nWhen a Resonator in the team takes a fatal blow, they will not be downed and will instead gain a Shield equal to 10% of Lily's Max HP for 10s. This effect can be triggered once every 5 min.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Fairytale's Finale</color> or <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Phantasm's End</color> grants <color=Highlight>Floral Blessing</color> to Resonators in the team.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Floral Blessing</color></size>\nLasts for 60s. When a Resonator in the team takes DMG that brings their HP below 50% of their Max HP, they restore HP equal to 50% of their Max HP, and <color=Highlight>Floral Blessing</color> is removed. This effect can be triggered once every 120s.",
+  "Skill_1006304_SkillResume": "Casting <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Eternal Bloom</color> additionally restores Concerto Energy.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Fairytale's Finale</color> or <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Phantasm's End</color> additionally restores Concerto Energy.",
+  "Skill_1006305_SkillDescribe": "While the active Resonator has 50% or more HP, Lily grants them 10% DMG Reduction.\nWhen a Resonator in the team takes a fatal blow, they will not be downed and will instead gain a Shield equal to 10% of Lily's Max HP for 10s. This effect can be triggered once every 5 min.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Fairytale's Finale</color> or <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Phantasm's End</color> grants <color=Highlight>Floral Blessing</color> to all Resonators in the team.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Floral Blessing</color></size>\nLasts for 60s. When a Resonator in the team takes DMG that brings their HP below 50% of their Max HP, they restore HP equal to 50% of their Max HP, and <color=Highlight>Floral Blessing</color> is removed. This effect can be triggered once every 120s.",
   "Skill_1006305_SkillName": "Flowers for You",
   "Skill_1006305_SkillResume": "While the active Resonator has high HP, Lily grants them DMG Reduction.\nWhen a Resonator in the team takes a fatal blow, they will not be downed and will instead gain a Shield.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Fairytale's Finale</color> or <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Phantasm's End</color> grants <color=Highlight>Floral Blessing</color> to Resonators in the team.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Floral Blessing</color></size>\nWhen a Resonator in the team takes DMG and drops to very low HP, restore their HP.",
-  "Skill_1006306_SkillDescribe": "<size=40><color=Title>First Bloom</color></size>\nAttack the target, dealing <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color>. {Cus:Ipt,Touch=Tap PC=Press Gamepad=Press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> shortly after casting this skill to cast Basic Attack Stage 3.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Eternal Bloom</color></size>\nAfter casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation - Into the Dream Cradle</color>, Lily's next Intro Skill <color=Highlight>First Bloom</color> is replaced with <color=Highlight>Eternal Bloom</color>. When cast, it attacks the target, dealing <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color>.\nFor every 1% of Lily's Energy Regen exceeding 100%, this skill gains an additional 0.5% Crit. Rate, up to 80%, and an additional 1% Crit. DMG, up to 160%.\n{Cus:Ipt,Touch=Tap PC=Press Gamepad=Press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> shortly after casting this skill to cast Basic Attack Stage 3.",
+  "Skill_1006306_SkillDescribe": "<size=40><color=Title>First Bloom</color></size>\nAttack the target, dealing <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color>. {Cus:Ipt,Touch=Tap PC=Press Gamepad=Press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> shortly after casting this skill to cast Basic Attack Stage 3.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Eternal Bloom</color></size>\nAfter casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation - Into the Dream Cradle</color>, Lily's next Intro Skill <color=Highlight>First Bloom</color> is replaced with <color=Highlight>Eternal Bloom</color>. When cast, it attacks the target, dealing <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color>.\nFor every 1% of Lily's Energy Regen exceeding 100%, this skill gains an additional 0.5% Crit. Rate, up to 80%, and an additional 1% Crit. DMG, up to 160%.\nCasting the skill grants <color=Highlight>Deep Dream Fragrance</color> for 8s. Casting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color> or <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color> consumes <color=Highlight>Deep Dream Fragrance</color> to additionally grant 100 points of <color=Highlight>Dreambell Chime</color>.\n{Cus:Ipt,Touch=Tap PC=Press Gamepad=Press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> shortly after casting this skill to cast Basic Attack Stage 3.",
   "Skill_1006306_SkillName": "Blooming Dream",
-  "Skill_1006306_SkillResume": "<size=40><color=Title>First Bloom</color></size>\nAttack the target, dealing <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color>.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Eternal Bloom</color></size>\nWhile <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation - Into the Dream Cradle</color> is active, Lily's Intro Skill <color=Highlight>First Bloom</color> is replaced with <color=Highlight>Eternal Bloom</color>. When cast, it attacks the target, dealing greater <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color>.",
-  "Skill_1006307_SkillDescribe": "<size=40><color=Title>Dream Perfume</color></size>\nLily can hold up to 300 points.\n<color=Highlight>Basic Attack</color>, <color=Highlight>Mid-air Attack</color>, and <color=Highlight>Dodge Counter</color> restore <color=Highlight>Dream Perfume</color> on hit.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Reverie Blend</color> or <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Nightmare Blend</color> restores <color=Highlight>Dream Perfume</color>.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color></size>\nWhen <color=Highlight>Dream Perfume</color> is full, hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color>, consuming all <color=Highlight>Dream Perfume</color> to pull in nearby targets, dealing <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color>. During the skill, she gains 10% DMG Reduction and continuously deals <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color> to nearby targets. She also heals all Resonators in the team every second for 2s.\nLily continuously gains <color=Highlight>Dreambell Chime</color> during the skill. When <color=Highlight>Dreambell Chime</color> reaches 300 points, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} or hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to stop the skill immediately and cast <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Fairytale's Finale</color>. <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Fairytale's Finale</color> is automatically cast at the end of <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color>. Casting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Fairytale's Finale</color> consumes all <color=Highlight>Dreambell Chime</color>.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Heavy Attack - Fairytale's Finale</color></size>\nAttack targets within range, dealing <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color>.\nFor every 1% of Lily's Energy Regen exceeding 100%, this skill gains an additional 0.5% Crit. Rate, up to 80%, and an additional 1% Crit. DMG, up to 160%.\nCasting the skill grants Lily <color=Highlight>Sillage</color> for 6s. Casting Outro Skill consumes <color=Highlight>Sillage</color> and grants <color=Highlight><te href=151202>Silvered Dream</te></color> to Resonators in the team. This effect can be triggered once every 25s.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color></size>\nWhen <color=Highlight>Dream Perfume</color> is full, hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Woven Phantasm</color>, consuming all <color=Highlight>Dream Perfume</color> to pull in nearby targets, dealing <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color>. She also heals all Resonators in the team every second for 2s.\nLily continuously gains <color=Highlight>Dreambell Chime</color> during the skill. When <color=Highlight>Dreambell Chime</color> reaches 300 points, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} or hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to stop the skill immediately and cast <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Phantasm's End</color>. <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Phantasm's End</color> is automatically cast at the end of <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color>. Casting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Phantasm's End</color> consumes all <color=Highlight>Dreambell Chime</color>.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Heavy Attack - Phantasm's End</color></size>\nAttack targets within range, dealing <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color>.\nFor every 1% of Lily's Energy Regen exceeding 100%, this skill gains an additional 0.5% Crit. Rate, up to 80%, and an additional 1% Crit. DMG, up to 160%.\nCasting this skill grants Lily <color=Highlight>Sillage</color> for 6s. Casting Outro Skill consumes <color=Highlight>Sillage</color> and grants <color=Highlight><te href=151202>Silvered Dream</te></color> to Resonators in the team. This effect can be triggered once every 25s.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Silvered Dream</color></size>\nLasts for 30s.\nWhen the Resonator with this effect is the Active Resonator and can trigger Unison Response, their ATK is increased by 7% for each stack of <color=Highlight><te href=131111>Unison Boon</te></color> the team has, counting up to 4 stacks of <color=Highlight><te href=131111>Unison Boon</te></color>.\nThe active Resonator's Echo Skill Crit. Rate is increased by 10%, and their Echo Skill Crit. DMG is increased by 20%.\nAll nearby Resonators in the team gain resistance to interruption.",
+  "Skill_1006306_SkillResume": "<size=40><color=Title>First Bloom</color></size>\nAttack the target, dealing <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color>.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Eternal Bloom</color></size>\nWhile <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation - Into the Dream Cradle</color> is active, Lily's Intro Skill <color=Highlight>First Bloom</color> is replaced with <color=Highlight>Eternal Bloom</color>. When cast, it attacks the target, dealing greater <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color>.\nAfter the skill is cast, casting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color> or <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color> additionally grants 100 points of <color=Highlight>Dreambell Chime</color>.",
+  "Skill_1006307_MultiSkillDescribe": "<size=40><color=Title>Dream Perfume</color></size>\nLily can hold up to 300 points.\n<color=Highlight>Basic Attack</color>, <color=Highlight>Mid-air Attack</color>, and <color=Highlight>Dodge Counter</color> restore <color=Highlight>Dream Perfume</color> on hit.\nAfter casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Reverie Blend</color> or <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Nightmare Blend</color>, restore 130 points of <color=Highlight>Dream Perfume</color>.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Eternal Bloom</color> restores 130 points of <color=Highlight>Dream Perfume</color>.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color></size>\nWhen <color=Highlight>Dream Perfume</color> is full, hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color>, consuming all <color=Highlight>Dream Perfume</color> to grant 1 stack of <color=Highlight>Dream Shelter</color>. During the skill, she pulls in nearby targets and continuously deals <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color> to them. She also heals all Resonators in the team every second for 2s.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color> grants Lily <color=Highlight>Wish of Praying Dream</color>, which can be gained once every 25s. When Lily has <color=Highlight>Wish of Praying Dream</color>, this <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color> consumes <color=Highlight>Wish of Praying Dream</color> to increase the healing by 400%.\nSwitching to another Resonator during <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color> stops the skills immediately.\nLily continuously gains <color=Highlight>Dreambell Chime</color> during the skill.\nWhen <color=Highlight>Dreambell Chime</color> reaches 300 points, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} or hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to stop the skill immediately and cast <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Fairytale's Finale</color>. <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Fairytale's Finale</color> is automatically cast at the end of <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color>. Casting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Fairytale's Finale</color> consumes all <color=Highlight>Dreambell Chime</color>.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Heavy Attack - Fairytale's Finale</color></size>\nAttack targets within range, dealing <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color>.\nFor every 1% of Lily's Energy Regen exceeding 100%, this skill gains an additional 0.5% Crit. Rate, up to 80%, and an additional 1% Crit. DMG, up to 160%.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color></size>\nWhen <color=Highlight>Dream Perfume</color> is full, hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color>, consuming all <color=Highlight>Dream Perfume</color> to grant 1 stack of <color=Highlight>Dream Shelter</color>. During the skill, she pulls in nearby targets and continuously deals <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color> to them. She also heals all Resonators in the team every second for 2s.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color> grants Lily <color=Highlight>Wish of Praying Dream</color>, which can be gained once every 25s. When Lily has <color=Highlight>Wish of Praying Dream</color>, this <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color> consumes <color=Highlight>Wish of Praying Dream</color> to increase the healing by 400%.\nSwitching to another Resonator during <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color> stops the skill immediately.\nLily continuously gains <color=Highlight>Dreambell Chime</color> during the skill.\nWhen <color=Highlight>Dreambell Chime</color> reaches 300 points, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} or hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to stop the skill immediately and cast <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Phantasm's End</color>. <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Phantasm's End</color> is automatically cast at the end of <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color>. Casting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Phantasm's End</color> consumes all <color=Highlight>Dreambell Chime</color>.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Heavy Attack - Phantasm's End</color></size>\nAttack targets within range, dealing <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color>.\nFor every 1% of Lily's Energy Regen exceeding 100%, this skill gains an additional 0.5% Crit. Rate, up to 80%, and an additional 1% Crit. DMG, up to 160%.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Dream Shelter</color></size>\nCasting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color> or <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color> grants 1 stack of <color=Highlight>Dream Shelter</color>, stacking up to 1 time. Receiving damage from an enemy target consumes 1 stack of <color=Highlight>Dream Shelter</color> to grant Lily immunity to interruption and reduce the DMG taken by 60% for 1s. This effect can be triggered once every 1s.",
+  "Skill_1006307_SkillDescribe": "<size=40><color=Title>Dream Perfume</color></size>\nLily can hold up to 300 points.\n<color=Highlight>Basic Attack</color>, <color=Highlight>Mid-air Attack</color>, and <color=Highlight>Dodge Counter</color> restore <color=Highlight>Dream Perfume</color> on hit.\nAfter casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Reverie Blend</color> or <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Nightmare Blend</color>, restore 130 points of <color=Highlight>Dream Perfume</color>.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Eternal Bloom</color> restores 130 points of <color=Highlight>Dream Perfume</color>.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color></size>\nWhen <color=Highlight>Dream Perfume</color> is full, hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color>, consuming all <color=Highlight>Dream Perfume</color> to grant 1 stack of <color=Highlight>Dream Shelter</color>. During the skill, she pulls in nearby targets and continuously deals <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color> to them. She also heals all Resonators in the team every second for 2s.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color> grants Lily <color=Highlight>Wish of Praying Dream</color>, which can be gained once every 25s. When Lily has <color=Highlight>Wish of Praying Dream</color>, this <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color> consumes <color=Highlight>Wish of Praying Dream</color> to increase the healing by 400%.\nSwitching to another Resonator during <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color> stops the skills immediately.\nLily continuously gains <color=Highlight>Dreambell Chime</color> during the skill.\nWhen <color=Highlight>Dreambell Chime</color> reaches 300 points, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} or hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to stop the skill immediately and cast <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Fairytale's Finale</color>. <colo